 –15 beginner CETa-style questions/problems covering Week 1 only.\n4. P
 redict current and voltage drops for a current-limited LED/resistor circ
 uit before Saturday's build.\n5. Write a short safe-DMM checklist: volta
 ge measurement\, resistance measurement\, and what not to do.\n\nMASTERY
  GATE: In plain language\, explain charge\, voltage\, current\, resistan
 ce\, power\, polarity\, open vs short\, and basic ESD/shock precautions\
 ; use SI prefixes\; solve fresh Ohm/Watt problems\; then build and safel
 y measure a current-limited LED circuit on Saturday.\n\nWEEK 1 START-FRO
