 www.youtube.com/watch?v=r-SCyD7f_zI\n• Electrical Safety Training: htt
 ps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TMT6f3tZQSk\n• GitHub Skills — Introduc
 tion to GitHub: https://github.com/skills/introduction-to-github\n\nREFE
 RENCE HUB — KEEP THESE LINKS:\n• Official Associate CET Study Guide\
 , 6th ed.: use your scanned/Google Drive copy and the PRINTED page numbe
 rs in BOOK ASSIGNMENT.\n• ETA 6th-ed. errata: https://www.etai.org/6th
