 Y: Starts from zero with safety\, units\, Ohm/Watt and the physical mean
 ing of voltage/current/resistance before circuit analysis.\nSOURCE RULE:
  The 6th-edition book is the primary CETa textbook. Current ETA competen
 cy wording + current ETA errata control whenever the older book differs 
