 emonstrate:\n• Solve Ohm's law and power problems with units and SI pr
 efixes.\n• Predict current\, voltage drop\, resistance\, and power bef
 ore measuring.\n• Explain why current limiting and correct meter conne
 ctions matter.\n\nCOVERAGE AUDIT\nThe assigned resources and tasks above
