 UIRED LEARNING OUTCOMES (WEEK 03)\nBy the end of this event\, you should
  be able to explain or demonstrate:\n• Select the correct DMM mode for
  voltage\, resistance\, continuity\, current\, and diode checks.\n• Ex
 plain correct meter placement and why current measurements are different
  from voltage measurements.\n• Set a bench supply voltage and current 
 limit and distinguish constant-voltage from constant-current operation.\
 n• Explain oscilloscope volts/div\, time/div\, triggering\, coupling\,
  probe attenuation\, and bandwidth at a basic working level.\n\nCOVERAGE
