 4.4\; 9.3\; 9.7\nCAREER/EMBEDDED PURPOSE: RC timing\, decoupling\, induc
 tive behavior\, waveform reading\; relate frequency-domain concepts to e
 mbedded signals.\n\nTHIS WEEK'S RESOURCES:\n- Capacitors and Inductors p
 laylist: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLB9A78ED3D7EF1AE5\n-ETA 
