 ircuits playlist: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL0o_zxa4K1BV9E-
 N8tSExU1djL6slnjbL\n\nMASTERY GATE: Convert frequency/period\, identify 
 peak/peak-to-peak/RMS\, explain phase qualitatively\, calculate RCtiming
 \, and capture an RC waveform.\n\nSYSTEM RULES: Watching alonenever coun
 ts. Use learn -> retrieve -> calculate/code -> build/measure-> debug -> 
