 e sine waves and basic AC quantities: amplitude\, peak\, peak-to-peak\, 
 frequency\, period\, phase\, and RMS.\n• Convert between frequency and
  period and interpret waveform measurements.\n• Explain how capacitors
  and inductors store energy and oppose changes in voltage or current.\n
