 –4.4\; 9.3\; 9.7\nCAREER/EMBEDDED PURPOSE: RC timing\, decoupling\, in
 ductive behavior\, waveform reading\; relate frequency-domain concepts t
 o embedded signals.\n\nTHIS WEEK'S RESOURCES:\n- Capacitors and Inductor
