 9E-N8tSExU1djL6slnjbL\n\nMASTERY GATE: Convert frequency/period\, identi
 fy peak/peak-to-peak/RMS\, explain phase qualitatively\, calculate RCtim
 ing\, and capture an RC waveform.\n\nSYSTEM RULES: Watching alonenever c
 ounts. Use learn -> retrieve -> calculate/code -> build/measure-> debug 
 -> document. Start each non-exam study block with ~10 minutes of spaced 
 recall. Never use a missed session as justification for anunhealthy make
 -up marathon.\n\nTODAY — ACTION CHECKLIST:\n1. Open LAB-004 — RC Tim
 e Constant + Filter Response in Practice → Lab Center → Week 04.\n2.
  Choose one route. Virtual needs: Web browser only. Physical needs: Osci
