 rs + Op-Amps + Gain + Loading\nETA/CETa SCOPE: 11.1–11.9\; 9.6\nCAREER
 /EMBEDDED PURPOSE: Analog signal conditioning for sensors\; gain\, feedb
 ack\, saturation/distortion\, bandwidth\, scope/meter loading.\n\nTHIS w
 eek's resources:\n- Transistor Bias & Amplifier Classes: https://www.you
 tube.com/watch?v=c6cmkm3UPUI\n- Op-Amp Circuits: https://www.youtube.com
