 le to explain or demonstrate:\n• Explain voltage gain\, current gain\,
  power gain\, loading\, input/output impedance\, and feedback.\n• Use 
 decibels at a basic technician level and relate d B changes to gain/loss
 .\n• Distinguish common amplifier classes and basic transistor/FET amp
 lifier roles.\n• Explain ideal op-amp assumptions at an introductory l
