 learn.sparkfun.com/tutorials/how-to-read-a-schematic/overview\n\nMASTERY
  GATE: Trace power/signal flow on an unfamiliar diagram\, choose next te
 st points\, locate a seeded fault\, and write a concise defect/root-caus
 e note.\n\nSYSTEM RULES: Watching alone never counts. Use learn ->retrie
 ve -> calculate/code -> build/measure -> debug -> document. start each n
 on-exam study block with ~10 minutes of spaced recall. Never use a misse
 d session as justification for an unhealthy make-up marathon.\n\nTODAY 
