 a Core → Career Core → Deep Dive. Complete the required work first\;
  use Deep Dive for repair or extra depth.\n\nWEEK 16 FOCUS: HOLIDAY LIGH
 T: STM32 Setup + GPIO + SWD Debug\nETA/CETa SCOPE: 13.12\; 15.3/15.6\; 1
 2.1–12.3 reinforcement\nCAREER/EMBEDDED PURPOSE: CubeIDE\, build/flash
 \, Cortex-M basics\, GPIO\, pin mux\, breakpoints\, watch variables/regi
