  16)\nBy the end of this event\, you should be able to explain or demons
 trate:\n• Explain what an MCU and ARM Cortex-M core are and identify f
 lash\, RAM\, GPIO\, clocks\, and peripherals in an STM32 system.\n• Cr
 eate/configure a basic STM32 project in STM32Cube IDE/CubeMX.\n• Confi
 gure GPIO input/output and understand pin multiplexing at a working leve
 l.\n• Build\, flash\, run\, and reset firmware on a real board.\n\nCOV
