 . Confirm logic analyzer and leads\, one supported I2C or SPI sensor/per
 ipheral breakout\, jumper wires\, pull-ups if required\, datasheet\, and
  safe voltage compatibility with the MCU.\n\n\nTODAY — ACTION CHECKLIS
 T:\n1. Open LAB-018 in Practice → Lab Center → Week 18.\n2. Virtual 
