 — SparkFun: https://learn.sparkfun.com/tutorials/serial-communication/
 all\n-pySerial docs: https://pyserial.readthedocs.io/\n\nMASTERY GATE: S
 end/receive MCU serial data\, parse/log it in Python\, explain basic com
 puter/software/networking concepts\, and recover from a malformed respon
 se.\n\nSYSTEM RULES: Watching alone never counts. Use learn ->retrieve -
 > calculate/code -> build/measure -> debug -> document. start each non-e
 xam study block with ~10 minutes of spaced recall. Never use a missed se
 ssion as justification for an unhealthy make-up marathon.\n\nTODAY — A
 CTION CHECKLIST:\n1. Open LAB-017 — UART + Python Serial Console in Pr
 actice → Lab Center → Week 17.\n2. Choose one route. Virtual needs: 
