  pySerial\, logic analyzer optional.\n3. Follow every numbered step unde
 r the route you selected\; predict the result before simulating\, buildi
 ng\, or measuring.\n4. Save the required evidence: Firmware + Python hos
 t script + serial-terminal capture + protocol/error note.\n5. Mark only 
