 onstrate:\n• Explain UART TX\, RX\, ground/reference\, baud rate\, fra
 me format\, and asynchronous serial communication.\n• Send and receive
  UART data between an STM32 and a host computer.\n• Use a terminal/ser
 ial monitor to inspect traffic and diagnose basic framing/configuration 
 problems.\n• Use Python/pySerial to open a port\, configure timeout/ba
 ud\, send commands\, read responses\, and close cleanly.\n• Parse and 
 log basic device responses from Python.\n• Explain how a host-side app
 lication can test or control an embedded device.\n\nCOVERAGE AUDIT\nThe 
