 \n• Recall and apply the core formula families required by the current
  CETa scope.\n• Identify common components\, symbols\, diagrams\, inst
 ruments\, and safety practices quickly and accurately.\n• Choose the c
 orrect measurement/test method from a scenario.\n• Navigate mixed elec
 tronics questions without relying on one-topic-at-a-time cues.\n\nCOVERA
