 very item in this outcome list. If you still cannot explain or demonstra
 te one of these items after the session\, do not count that item as comp
 lete. Write the concept on a short catch-up list and use the linked offi
 cial or supplemental resource before closing the gap.\n\nSIMPLE COMPLETI
 ON RULE\nFinish the assigned work\, then check the learning outcomes bel
