 he integrated build.\n2. Verify nonblocking timing\, inputs\, outputs\, 
 serial diagnostics\, and normal state transitions.\n3. Test timeout/erro
 r behavior by disconnecting or delaying one dependency\; confirm the sys
 tem enters a known error state and can recover safely.\n4. Use debugger\
 , serial log\, scope\, or logic-analyzer evidence to isolate and correct
