 emonstrate:\n• Design and execute deliberate fault-injection tests.\n
 • Use the troubleshooting sequence: reproduce\, measure\, isolate\, hy
 pothesize\, test\, fix\, and verify.\n• Distinguish hardware\, firmwar
 e\, interface\, test-fixture\, power\, and host-script faults.\n• Coll
 ect DMM/scope/logic-analyzer/log evidence that supports root cause.\n\nC
