 \; use Deep Dive for repair or extra depth.\n\nWEEK 31 FOCUS: APPLICATIO
 N SPRINT + Interview Feedback Loop\nETA/CETa SCOPE: No new CETa content\
 nCAREER/EMBEDDED PURPOSE: Begin permanent full-time bridge-job applicati
 ons\; track requested skills\, interview questions and gaps\; keep schoo
 l-compatible job filter.\n\nTHIS WEEK'S RESOURCES:\n- Use the project/re
 adiness resources already in your guide.\n\nMASTERY GATE: Apply only to 
 genuine electronics/hardware/R&D/test roles\; use market feedback to imp
 roveweak skills without delaying applications for optional perfection.\n
 \nSYSTEM RULES: Watching alone never counts. Use learn ->retrieve -> cal
 culate/code -> build/measure -> debug -> document. start each non-exam s
