 e technical and behavioral interviews using real project/troubleshooting
  stories.\n• Track interview misses and convert them into dated learni
 ng repairs.\n• Maintain the portfolio while applying without restartin
 g the entire curriculum.\n• Use market feedback to refine role targeti
 ng while preserving the embedded-systems trajectory.\n\nCOVERAGE AUDIT\n
 The assigned resources and tasks above are intended to cover every item 
 in this outcome list. If you still cannot explain or demonstrate one of 
